WEBVTT

00:00:07.389 --> 00:00:09.609
Hermione:
WHAT ARE YOU DOING?

00:00:09.652 --> 00:00:11.306
WE HAVE TO KEEP IT SAFE

00:00:11.350 --> 00:00:13.961
UNTIL WE FIND OUT
HOW TO DESTROY IT.

00:00:14.004 --> 00:00:16.006
SEEMS STRANGE, MATE.

00:00:16.050 --> 00:00:18.574
DUMBLEDORE SENDS YOU OFF
TO FIND ALL THESE HORCRUXES

00:00:18.618 --> 00:00:20.707
BUT DOESN'T TELL YOU
HOW TO DESTROY THEM.

00:00:20.750 --> 00:00:22.578
DOESN'T THAT BOTHER YOU?

00:00:28.715 --> 00:00:30.282
[ SIGHS ]

00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:37.593
Man on radio: A GOBLIN BY THE
NAME OF GORNUK WAS ALSO KILLED.

00:00:37.637 --> 00:00:40.292
IT IS BELIEVED
THAT MUGGLE-BORN DEAN THOMAS

00:00:40.335 --> 00:00:43.599
AND A SECOND GOBLIN, BOTH
BELIEVED TO HAVE BEEN TRAVELING

00:00:43.643 --> 00:00:46.428
WITH TONKS, CRESSWELL,
AND GORNUK MAY HAVE ESCAPED.

00:00:46.472 --> 00:00:48.256
IF DEAN IS LISTENING

00:00:48.300 --> 00:00:50.345
OR ANYONE HAS ANY KNOWLEDGE
ABOUT HIS WHEREABOUTS,

00:00:50.389 --> 00:00:52.869
HIS PARENTS...

00:00:56.656 --> 00:01:00.007
VOLDEMORT:
You know the spell, Harry.

00:01:01.704 --> 00:01:03.706
[ GASPS ]

00:01:03.750 --> 00:01:05.534
TELL ME.

00:01:07.623 --> 00:01:10.322
TELL ME, GREGOROVITCH.

00:01:10.365 --> 00:01:11.975
Gregorovitch:
IT WAS STOLEN FROM ME.

00:01:12.019 --> 00:01:13.629
WHO WAS HE --

00:01:13.673 --> 00:01:15.892
THE THIEF?

00:01:18.721 --> 00:01:20.680
IT WAS A BOY.

00:01:20.723 --> 00:01:22.595
IT WAS HE WHO TOOK IT.

00:01:22.638 --> 00:01:25.293
I NEVER SAW IT AGAIN.

00:01:25.337 --> 00:01:27.251
I SWEAR ON MY LIFE.

00:01:27.295 --> 00:01:29.166
[ CHUCKLES]
I BELIEVE YOU.

00:01:29.210 --> 00:01:31.691
[ SOBBING]

00:01:33.432 --> 00:01:34.998
[ BREATHING HEAVILY ]

00:01:35.042 --> 00:01:37.044
AVADA KEDAVRA!

00:01:37.087 --> 00:01:38.175
AAH!

00:01:39.612 --> 00:01:42.484
[ BREATHING HEAVILY ]

00:01:42.528 --> 00:01:46.706
[ MAN SPEAKING INDISTINCTLY
OVER RADIO ]

00:01:46.749 --> 00:01:48.795
THAT'S RIGHT AND...

00:01:48.838 --> 00:01:51.319
MAXWELL P. WARRINGTON...

00:01:51.363 --> 00:01:53.190
I THOUGHT IT HAD STOPPED.

00:01:53.234 --> 00:01:54.409
[ SIGHS ]

00:01:54.453 --> 00:01:57.499
YOU CAN'T KEEP
LETTING HIM IN, HARRY.

00:01:57.543 --> 00:02:01.764
YOU-KNOW-WHO HAS FOUND
GREGOROVITCH.

00:02:01.808 --> 00:02:03.549
THE WANDMAKER?

00:02:03.592 --> 00:02:06.203
HE W-WANTS SOMETHING

00:02:06.247 --> 00:02:09.206
THAT GREGOROVITCH
USED TO HAVE,

00:02:09.250 --> 00:02:10.643
BUT I DON'T KNOW WHAT.

00:02:10.686 --> 00:02:12.732
BUT HE W-WANTS IT
DESPERATELY.

00:02:12.775 --> 00:02:15.648
I MEAN [INHALES DEEPLY] IT'S
AS IF HIS LIFE DEPENDS ON IT.

00:02:15.691 --> 00:02:18.433
DESPITE RECENT SETBACKS,
THERE WAS REASON TO...

00:02:18.477 --> 00:02:19.956
DON'T!

00:02:20.000 --> 00:02:22.350
IT COMFORTS HIM.IT SETS MY TEETH
ON EDGE.

00:02:22.394 --> 00:02:24.004
WHAT'S HE EXPECTING TO HEAR,
GOOD NEWS?

00:02:24.047 --> 00:02:25.875
EVEN FOR THOSE
WHO LONG EXPECTED IT,

00:02:25.919 --> 00:02:27.790
THE FALL OF THE MINISTRY
WAS SHOCKING.

00:02:27.834 --> 00:02:30.314
I THINK HE JUST HOPES
HE DOESN'T HEAR BADNEWS.

00:02:30.358 --> 00:02:32.447
WE PROMISE TO REMAIN...

00:02:32.491 --> 00:02:35.450
HOW LONG
BEFORE HE CAN TRAVEL?

00:02:35.494 --> 00:02:37.409
[ SIGHS ]

00:02:37.452 --> 00:02:40.499
I-I'M DOING
EVERYTHING I CAN.
YOU'RE NOT
DOING ENOUGH!

00:02:43.240 --> 00:02:45.460
Hermione: TAKE IT OFF.

00:02:45.504 --> 00:02:48.158
I SAID
TAKE IT OFF NOW.

00:02:59.300 --> 00:03:01.084
BETTER?

00:03:01.128 --> 00:03:02.390
LOADS.

00:03:05.741 --> 00:03:08.048
WE'LL TAKE IT
IN TURNS, OKAY?

00:03:21.409 --> 00:03:24.194
[ TWIG SNAPS ]

00:03:29.417 --> 00:03:32.333
[ STATIC, RADIO TUNING]

00:03:37.251 --> 00:03:38.644
...FINCH DOES ADMIT

00:03:38.687 --> 00:03:40.820
HIS INVENTION
CURRENTLY HAS ONE SHORT.

00:03:40.863 --> 00:03:42.604
AND NOW, OTHER NEWS --

00:03:42.648 --> 00:03:45.868
SEVERUS SNAPE, NEWLY APPOINTED
HEADMASTER OF HOGWARTS,

00:03:45.912 --> 00:03:49.785
HAS DECREED THAT ALL STUDENTS
MUST CONFORM...

00:04:09.370 --> 00:04:12.112
[ SIGHS ]

00:04:12.155 --> 00:04:16.029
[ RADIO TUNING]

00:04:16.072 --> 00:04:18.945
HOGWARTS
BEARS LITTLE RESEMBLANCE

00:04:18.988 --> 00:04:21.817
TO THE SCHOOL
UNDER DUMBLEDORE'S LEADERSHIP.

00:04:21.861 --> 00:04:23.427
SNAPE'S CURRICULUM IS SEVERE,

00:04:23.471 --> 00:04:25.691
REFLECTING THE WISHES
OF THE DARK LORD,

00:04:25.734 --> 00:04:28.607
AND INFRACTIONS
ARE DEALT WITH HARSHLY

00:04:28.650 --> 00:04:31.479
BY THE TWO DEATH EATERS
ON THE STAFF.

00:04:31.523 --> 00:04:34.743
[ RUSTLING ]

